  description: Ajwa dates are small, dark and soft. They are gently sweet and very
    special to many families.
  origin: Madinah, Saudi Arabia
  appearance: Dark brown to almost black, with thin wrinkly skin
  texture: Soft and a little chewy
  taste: Gently sweet with a hint of fruity flavour
  funFact: Ajwa dates are famous in Madinah and are treasured as a special treat.
  benefits:
  - Natural energy boost
  - Good source of fibre
  - A tasty, healthy snack
  nutritionNote: Like most dates, it has natural sugars for energy, plus fibre and
    minerals such as potassium.
  quizFeedback: Ajwa is a premium date variety from Madinah.
